  Title: GoldPond
  Prompt: Stopping at a river for water, you see something shiny in the water. The
    rivers are treacherous, but it's the unmistakenable sheen of gold.
  Sprite: {fileID: 0}
  ChoicesToDisplay: 2
  Choices:
  - Text: Ford the river!
    SuccessChance: 0.91
    _successText: Gold
    SuccessOutcomeData:
      Text: Reaching into the water, you're rewarded with the contents of an entire
        pouch of gold! You add 22 gold to your reserves.
      Outcomes:
      - Type: 1
        _moneyDelta: 22
        _equipment: {fileID: 0}
        _newHire: {fileID: 0}
        _damageAmount: 0
        _numMapTiles: 0
    FailureOutcomeData:
      Text: Floundering in the water, you eventually seek out your reward. Dissapointingly,
        it turns out just to be lustrous scraps of metal. You will be cold tonight.
      Outcomes: []
  - Text: It's not worth the swim.
    SuccessChance: 1
    _successText: 
    SuccessOutcomeData:
      Text: 
      Outcomes: []
    FailureOutcomeData:
      Text: 
      Outcomes: []
